NV_PK(1,{"farmland green tree frog":"","an endemic green tree frog first found in chiayi in 1995 and named after zhuluo chiayi's old name unlike other green tree frogs that live in forests it lives in bamboo groves and orchards on farmland in yunlin chiayi and tainan":"","taiwan blue magpie":"","sky":"","an endemic bird with a long blue tail people call it the 'long tailed mountain lady' and it often flies in a line like a family team":"","mikado pheasant":"","an endemic pheasant of high mountain forests 'mikado' is an old word for the japanese emperor and the bird appears on the nt 1 000 note":"","black faced spoonbill":"","a bird with a black spoon shaped beak more than half of the world's spoonbills spend the winter in taiwan mostly at qigu in tainan":"","purple crow butterfly":""});